# SPA fallback. The shim is one page; a deep link like /revolucion/lounge is a
# LOCATION inside the hive, not a file, so an unknown path must serve the shell
# and let Navigation read the pathname.
#
# Order matters and existing files win: Cloudflare Pages serves a real asset
# before it consults this file, so /<sig>, /content/<sig>, /pin and every built
# asset are answered directly and never reach the rule below. That is what
# keeps a host able to serve its OWN content — a blanket 200-rewrite would
# hand index.html to every signature request and make the origin's heap
# invisible to the nodes replicating from it.
/*    /index.html   200
